# Campuz360 core

- Vertical microfrontends: separate Next.js apps under `apps/*`, composed by Shell **rewrites**, not Module Federation.
- Stack: Next.js App Router, TypeScript, Tailwind v4, Radix via `@campuz360/ui`, Supabase Auth+RLS, pnpm + Turborepo.
- Shared code only in `packages/{ui,auth,contracts,config}`.
- Hosting and Supabase are cohort-owned accounts — never hardcode cloud project IDs or commit secrets.
- Follow `AGENTS.md` and `docs/` (architecture, boundaries, design, security).
- Prefer minimal diffs scoped to the user’s MFE. Ask before large cross-cutting refactors.
